{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","name_native":"সুনান আন-নাসায়ী","section":{"22":"The Book of Fasting"},"section_detail":{"22":{"hadithnumber_first":2090,"hadithnumber_last":2434,"arabicnumber_first":2090,"arabicnumber_last":2434,"name_native":"সিয়াম (রোজা) অধ্যায়"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2224,"arabicnumber":2224,"text":"। মুহাম্মাদ ইবনু ইসমাঈল (রহঃ) ... মু’আয ইবনু জাবাল (রাঃ) থেকে বর্ণিত। তিনি বলেন যে, সাওম (রোযা/রোজা/সিয়াম/ছিয়াম) ঢালস্বরূপ।","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":22,"hadith":135}}]}